@startuml sd14_throughput
!include ../style.iuml
title SD-14 View throughput metrics (UC-14)
autonumber

actor Dispatcher as D
box "CTC Office process" #F7F9FC
participant "ThroughputPanel\n/ ThroughputHistory" as Thr
participant "CtcHost" as Host
participant "StubCtcOffice" as Model
end box

note over Host
  Each step (SD-23) step_at calls _count_sales(sim_time_s, inputs):
  that step's ticket sales go to the clock hour they fall in, per line.
end note
loop after each step
  Host -> Thr : clockChanged()
  Thr -> Host : throughput, throughputRows
  Host -> Model : snapshot()
  Model --> Host : tickets sold per station since 05:00;\nelapsed time
  note right of Host
    Per line: tickets ÷ hours elapsed
    ("–" until a simulated minute has passed).
  end note
  Host --> Thr : Tickets/hr, Green line and Red line
  Thr -> Host : throughputHistory
  Host --> Thr : 12 clock hours (HH:00), tickets per line\nper hour, shared peak, current hour
  Thr -> D : tiles, per-line table, one bar chart per line
end
D -> Thr : MouseArea.containsMouseChanged()
Thr -> Thr : hovered = slot.key\nhoverText()
Thr -> D : tickets sold in that hour
@enduml
